*******************************************
	   LRO TRAJECTORY INTEGRATOR
*******************************************

Author: Sergio Coll-Ibars
Date: 04/01/2026

Description: Integrate the LRO trajectory using 
	initial conditions from the SPICE ephem.
	Uses the GRGM1200 Lunar gravity model 
	and SRP model using shadow functions.

Input: simulation_config.txt
Output: specified in input files. Saves trajectory
	ephemerides

Launch: ./lro_ephem_spice_moon_parallel simulation_config.txt  
